#: krandrmodule.cpp:46
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Your X server does not support resizing and rotating the display. Please "
#| "update to version 4.3 or greater. You need the X Resize And Rotate "
#| "extension (RANDR) version 1.1 or greater to use this feature."
msgid ""
"Your X server does not support resizing and rotating the display. Please "
"update to version 4.3 or greater. You need the X Resize, Rotate, and Reflect "
"extension (RANDR) version 1.1 or greater to use this feature."
msgstr ""
"O seu servidor X non soporta mudar o tamaño e xirar a pantalla. Por favor, "
"anove á versión 4.3 ou posterior. Precisa a extensión X Resize And Rotate "
"(RANDR), versión 1.1 ou posterior, para facer uso desta funcionalidade."

